1
00:00:04,379 --> 00:00:07,549
(Howard:)Boy, seems like forever since
the four of us have been out to eat.

2
00:00:07,716 --> 00:00:09,676
You know, just the guys.

3
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:13,843
Oh, God. Yes, we get it.
You have a girlfriend now.

4
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:17,685
(Howard:)-A little jealous, are we?
-No, I'm not jealous.

5
00:00:20,145 --> 00:00:23,735
All right, I'd kill a hobo if it would
get me laid. Now, can we order?

6
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:27,320
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear Lord, they redid the menu.

7
00:00:27,485 --> 00:00:29,235
(Leonard:)So what? It's the same food.

8
00:00:29,404 --> 00:00:31,034
(Sheldon:)Oh, is it? Look at this.

9
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:34,197
(Sheldon:)General Tso's Chicken
is no longer listed under "specialties."

10
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:36,197
It's now under "chicken."

11
00:00:36,578 --> 00:00:40,168
(Raj:)-So?
-Yes, General Tso.

12
00:00:41,249 --> 00:00:44,089
Not "Tso" the chicken,
"so" the question.

13
00:00:45,253 --> 00:00:49,883
(Raj:)-So?
-So why is it no longer a specialty?

14
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:53,590
(Sheldon:)Did the chef lose confidence
in the dish or himself?

15
00:00:53,762 --> 00:00:58,102
(Sheldon:)And look over here.
"Shrimp in mobster sauce."

16
00:00:58,808 --> 00:01:01,308
(Sheldon:)What is mobster sauce?

